Subject: [PATCH] Add blog: how long does the Amazon bestseller badge last

- templates/blog/how-long-does-amazon-bestseller-badge-last.html: article in
  founder voice with observed badge re-appearance data, FAQ + Article JSON-LD,
  CTA to /#pricing, blurred capture (desktop crop + phone crop)
- templates/blog/index.html + BLOG_POSTS registry, /blog and /blog/<slug>
  routes (slug validated against an allow-list, unknown -> 404)
- /sitemap.xml and /robots.txt
- Blog link in landing footer
- /screenshot/<id>: @login_required + ownership check (admins keep
  cross-account access for /debug/all_screenshots)

