+            <p class="post-kicker">Amazon badges, explained</p>
+            <h1>How long does the Amazon bestseller badge last?</h1>
+            <p class="post-meta">By <a href="/">Josh Matern</a>, founder of Screenshot Tracker · September 18, 2026 · 7 min read</p>
